{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411310","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1241131001:1":{"text":"かつての緑水村がどんな場所だったか知りたいか？","source_cn":"你们知道，之前的绿水村是什么样的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE542ACF611CA3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1241131001":{"text":"かつての緑水村がどんな場所だったか知りたいか？","source_cn":"你们知道，之前的绿水村是什么样的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE542ACF611CA3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241131002:1":{"text":"昔の緑水村は、とても豊かな村だった。","source_cn":"之前的绿水村是非常富饶的村庄。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11EA49B7F97CE63F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241131003:1":{"text":"この辺りの海は水が綺麗で、<style=\"highlight\">シルバーウェーブ</style>という魚がよく取れるのだ。","source_cn":"这里的海域水很清澈，盛产一种叫<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x107118EEAB118842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241131004:1":{"text":"漁獲量が多く、味が良くて、長距離の輸送にも耐えられる魚だがら、ラスティーアンカーから各地へ輸出されていた。","source_cn":"这种鱼因为味美，耐长途运输，产量大，被从锈锚港销往很多地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD349CDFFC9DBB29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241131005:1":{"text":"あの頃は、魚を積んだ船が港から次々と出港しては、遠い国の香辛料や織物、植物の種などを持ち帰っていたものだよ。","source_cn":"那时候，一艘又一艘装着鱼获的船驶出锈锚港，返航时则带回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB816FB93E446A09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241131006:1":{"text":"昔はとても栄えていたんですね。今は港にほとんど人なんていないのに……","source_cn":"原来锈锚港以前这么繁荣，但现在港口冷清得连个人都没有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30FA4705EFF3AD50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241131007:1":{"text":"この村も、昔は栄えていたなんて想像もできません……","source_cn":"现在这个村子让人完全联想不到富饶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2C51B34299C839A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241131008:1":{"text":"村に幽霊が出るという噂を聞いて、部下を調査に来させたが、その時は何も情報を得られなかった。","source_cn":"这里传出闹鬼的传闻后，我派人来这里探查过，但一无所获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BE7C329D5B3B424","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241131009:1":{"text":"それどころか、派遣した部下は誰ひとり帰ってこなかったんだ。","source_cn":"甚至我派的人，都没有回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA39CC6DD640D1EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1241131009":{"text":"それどころか、派遣した部下は誰ひとり帰ってこなかったんだ。","source_cn":"甚至我派的人，都没有回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA39CC6DD640D1EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241131010:1":{"text":"酔っ払った漁師が騒いでいたのだ。霧の中から叫び声が聞こえたり、幽霊の影が見えるとな。","source_cn":"一个喝醉的渔民说的，说雾气里有尖声怪叫，鬼影幢幢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC90E4D21DFBE5EDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241131011:1":{"text":"実際に幽霊を目撃したとも言い、その直後に正気を失ってしまった。だからその話を信じる者もたくさんいる。","source_cn":"他声称撞见幽灵，然后就疯了，因此很多人都相信他说的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0715C92BBF5ECA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1241131011":{"text":"実際に幽霊を目撃したとも言い、その直後に正気を失ってしまった。だからその話を信じる者もたくさんいる。","source_cn":"他声称撞见幽灵，然后就疯了，因此很多人都相信他说的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0715C92BBF5ECA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241131012:1":{"text":"たとえ本当だったとしても、彼らはきっと警告しに来たのだと思う。","source_cn":"即使有，那些幽灵传出的讯息也应该是警示。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0169F3DD4A7E3593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","documen